      "power": 0.8,
      "selection_rule": "least severe rung whose paired clean-minus-fault difference is at least 0.25 with at least 3 discordant seed pairs and an exact 95% lower bound above 0.5 on the clean-only share of discordant pairs; sham must show parity",
